But, I have some doubts regarding the same:
1. I have implemented the pander(x) function on the CrossTable of a two variables from a dataset, whose length is 2000.
    My RStudio console is taking a very long time to process that command, so I am forced to terminate it, which then returns me the following error:

  No pander method for "CrossTable", reverting to default.

I have implemented various pander methods on the dataset, all of which seem to work quite well, except for that in which I have a CrossTable implementation. If you can please solve my doubts regarding this, I would be sending a pull request with my implementation soon.

I addition, I want to mention that the pander method is working fine on the CrossTable, implemented on the mtcars dataset.

regards,

Jalem Raj Rohit

