Sorry, it seems that I should have used more explicit terminology: instead of calling "pander" on a "CrossTable" object, you should create a method for "pander" that would deal with "CrossTable" objects. In short: write code for the function that is named to "pandoc.CrossTable". See: http://adv-r.had.co.nz/OO-essentials.html#s3

The ~~error~~warning message says the same: "there is no method for CrossTable", and the default "pander" method is called -- which is "pander.list".

Please let me know if you would need any further help.

Best,
Gergely

