Hi Raj,

I suggest to continue this discussion in private mails instead not to spam the mailbox of other GSoC mentors and students. So please feel free to mail me directly with any project-specific test-related questions, and I suggest to do the same for other candidates.

About your R code: we are closer to a promising solution, but that are bunch of stuff to tweak there. E.g. your function does not seems to work ATM, there's no need to call CrossTable there, and you never return m, m1 and m2.

Please read the docs on S3 and some other related materials from the adv-r book I referenced in a previous mail, it's an extremely great (and free) resource on R package development.

Best,
Gergely

