Hi all,

The ideas page mentions Micheal Lawrence as the mentor.
The test task for the Interactive plots for scientific reports is to use ggbio::autoplot to plot one of the GRanges objects created by example <http://rwiki.sciviews.org/rhelp.php?id=example>(GRanges) and create an equivalent D3-based plot that displays the some aspect of the ranges (like the score) as a tooltip on mouse over.

I have created a quite similar project. Please let me know if this is acceptable as an entrance task. I am familiar with frameworks like D3 but I am not sure if I'll be able to complete the second part of the task due to lack of time (only a day remaining to submit proposal).
PFA the file.

Thanks,
Shubham

